request 例(example) v1 "例"

use organization 組織(org) from "shared/小さい会社.ringi"
use calendar 事務所(office) from "shared/事務所.cal"

form
  金額(amount)       : money[円] "金額"  range >=1円 <=100_000円
  承認者(approver)   : text "承認者への申し送り"  count <=40  optional

route
  確かめ(check)  上長

who
  上長(manager) = manager of requester
  社長(top)     = person "e04"

every stage
  due in 3 business days at end of day
  when late escalate by 上へ, then expire

table 上へ(up)
| 承認者(approver) | -> 回す先(goes_to) |
| 上長             | 社長               |
| 社長             | 社長               |

ticket
  self approval  not allowed
